# Compatibility matrix: meridian-checkout on APM v0.33.0

Generated by matrix_tool.py from the install runs in this evidence folder. Each row is a fresh copy of the fixture installed with `apm install --target <target>` (experimental rows after `apm experimental enable <target>`). `-` means APM wrote nothing for that primitive. Paths starting with `~/` are user-level files written into the run's isolated HOME.

